{"unit_id":"wakeup595626-cmyk__dsh-drop-to-path#card-zh","repo":"wakeup595626-cmyk/dsh-drop-to-path","commit":"484c2818b00c51cb93b948443d5f703ae009355f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Drop to Path 是面向 DSH Web 的文件路径附件插件。它在网页端接收拖放或粘贴的图片、普通文件和文件夹，将内容写入会话工作区的 .drops/，并在发送消息时把文件路径交给模型。图片仍可使用原生附件预览，其他文件显示为附件栏卡片；文件夹上传会保留内部目录结构。适合需要让文本模型读取本地文档、图片或资料目录的 DSH Web 用户。无需 API Key，文件保存在本机工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:203-248","lib/client.js:846-890"]}
{"unit_id":"wakeup595626-cmyk__dsh-drop-to-path#card-en","repo":"wakeup595626-cmyk/dsh-drop-to-path","commit":"484c2818b00c51cb93b948443d5f703ae009355f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Drop to Path turns files dropped or pasted into DSH Web into workspace paths. It saves them under .drops/ and adds paths to prompts. Images retain previews, other files appear as chips, and folder uploads preserve structure. It helps text-only models read local files; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:203-248","lib/client.js:846-890"]}
